\alttext(Exact recorded true-row predicted-column counts rendered by the confusion-matrix SVG API.)

> Verification and limits

Eight native tests check independent wide convolution/embedding values and
all80tiny parameter finite differences,built-in Adadelta every history/weight
coordinate plus head projection,dropout every value/shared-mask adjoint,
extreme CE/all logit derivatives,full9-leaf backward,every original source
word/length/label/ID and fitting-only ranked vocabulary,duplicate-word-group
separation,every count/NB oracle score,visible SGD parity and padding controls.
All public Doxygen examples compile/run,standalone headers and the original
three-epoch workflow pass. Original data strings remain available for audit.

This small balanced MR holdout and CNN-rand fit do not reproduce a published
cross-validation protocol or pretrained-embedding model. Sentence snippets
are not independent movies/authors by construction. Initial/fitted maps,
unknown substitutions and isolated head constraints establish implementation
contracts;actual held-out sentiment errors determine the model comparison.

> Conclusion

The tensor optimizer and classifier constraint are visible in every update. Original snippets,complete held-out class counts and the fixed count reference constrain conclusions beyond lower fitting loss. These are custom CNN-rand teaching results,not published cross-validation accuracy.

> References

- [Kim(2014),Convolutional Neural Networks for Sentence Classification](https://aclanthology.org/D14-1181/).
- [Zeiler(2012),ADADELTA:An Adaptive Learning Rate Method](https://arxiv.org/abs/1212.5701).
- [Official Pang/Lee MR sentence-polarity v1.0 data](https://www.cs.cornell.edu/people/pabo/movie-review-data/).
